CREATE TRIGGER DocumentsDefInsert ON DocumentsDef FOR INSERT AS DECLARE @MID      INT DECLARE @VSLastId INT SELECT  @MID=DocumentID from Inserted SELECT @VSLastId=LastID from TablesID WHERE TablesID.TableName='DocumentsDef' IF @MID > @VSLastId BEGIN  RETURN END  Insert Operations (OperationID, OperationType, OperationTable)  SELECT Inserted.DocumentID, 'Insert' AS OperationType , 'DocumentsDef' AS OperationTable From Inserted 